{"text": "ladybug", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">lady</i> +\u200e <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">bug</i>, the \u201clady\u201d here referring to Virgin Mary, the mother of Jesus. Compare German <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"de\">Marienk\u00e4fer</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "(Canada, US) Synonym of ladybird.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["US", "/\u02c8le\u026a.di.b\u028c\u0261/"]]}